{"id":377710,"shortDescription":"Matsushima Michiru is a loved, respected, nationally-famous idol, worthy of singing on the same stage as the legendary Kazami Kazuki... in her own dreams, at least. In reality, she's a complete nobody, only able to perform in a dingy basement bar on the weekends for crowds numbering in the single digits.","developers":["Frontwing"],"publishers":["Frontwing USA"],"categories":["Un jugador","Cromos de Steam","Controles de volumen personalizados","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Guardar en cualquier momento","Sonido estéreo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"29 JUL 2015","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/377710?t=1790567626","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_5b78e249888bbbecea2a97a725be1db4993692e2.600x338.jpg?t=1790567626","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_5b78e249888bbbecea2a97a725be1db4993692e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790567626"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_3ef06da8a999debb948a4937531863a942fe2672.600x338.jpg?t=1790567626","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_3ef06da8a999debb948a4937531863a942fe2672.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790567626"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_224b045eabb3c4ef401b8e0d64f2452f7b1d671c.600x338.jpg?t=1790567626","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_224b045eabb3c4ef401b8e0d64f2452f7b1d671c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790567626"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_f2e9d3158a249125fa6ace371e79686c2c1a0766.600x338.jpg?t=1790567626","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/377710/ss_f2e9d3158a249125fa6ace371e79686c2c1a0766.1920